# Final Phase 7 Objective

At the end of this phase, Deck Estimator should have a functioning AI-assisted visual condition analysis capability that can:

1. Accept existing deck photographs.
2. Assess image quality.
3. Classify the deck into one of five visible condition levels.
4. Identify multiple visible defects.
5. Provide confidence information.
6. Recognize uncertain or unsuitable images.
7. Recommend manual review when appropriate.
8. Preserve analysis history and model versions.
9. Integrate securely with the existing MERN application.

The final objective is not simply to build an AI API.

It is to build a **reproducible, testable, transparent, and responsibly integrated deck-condition analysis system.**